determine the parity of the n

this will let us know how many odds and evens there are for indexing in the odd or even space

odd n
num of evens n / 2
num of odds evens + 1

even n 
num of even = num of odds = n /2

there are 2 formuals to traverse in the odd space or even space

for odd space up the num odds:
2*k - 1

for even space is the complement after k odds
2(n - num_odds)
